// ============================================================================
// The canopy's people (Chapter 4), outside the story: the colony's named
// people and its folk, for wandering the canopy before the days are built.
// DRAFT lines for the designer to rewrite. Everyone up here knows exactly
// what the tree is; you don't, yet, and you're scared and shocked (designer).
// ============================================================================

=== c4_grounded ===
{"There you are. Sit, if you can find a chair under all this."|"Read anything you like. That's what it's there for."|"Not now. Later. I promise you, later."} #speaker:grounded
-> END

=== c4_master ===
{"Don't look at me like that. I know. I watched them watch me go, too."|"Pass me that. No, the bottle."|"Every one of these goes down tonight with somebody's hopes on it. Don't think about it."} #speaker:master
-> END

=== c4_quartermaster ===
{"New mouth. Bowl's by the stove. One bowl."|"Everything that comes up, I count. Everything that goes down, I count. Don't make me count you."|"Eat. You look like the roots."} #speaker:quartermaster
-> END

=== c4_doubter ===
{"You're from the roots too? Then you'll know. It's good up here. It's so good up here."|"Don't make trouble. That's all I'd say. Don't make trouble."} #speaker:doubter
-> END

=== c4_keeper ===
{"You've been in there! Inside! What's it like? Is it dark? Is it warm?"|"Is it true they sing at the rites? All of them at once?"|"I've drawn it. Look. Is it like this? Is it?"} #speaker:keeper
-> END

=== c4_messenger ===
{"Passing through."|"I don't stay. Nobody pays me to stay."} #speaker:messenger
-> END

=== c4_hunter ===
{"What the fuck are you staring at? It's a bow."|"Down there's where the food is. Up here's where the talking is. Guess where I'd rather be."|"Stars. Bloody beautiful, aren't they. Don't tell anyone I said that."} #speaker:hunter
-> END

=== c4_child ===
{"..."|"I was hungry. I'm sorry. It was just there."} #speaker:child
-> END

// --- Folk, by place (each speaks with their own face) ---

=== c4_folk_tube ===
{"Morning's lot. Same as ever."|"Mind the basin. Things come down fast."|"Comb, comb, bowl, comb. You'd think they'd make something new."} #speaker:them
-> END

=== c4_folk_sorting ===
{"Keep. Keep. On. On. On."|"Don't touch the baskets, they're counted."|"You'd be surprised what people think the Canopy wants."} #speaker:them
-> END

=== c4_folk_mess ===
{"Sit anywhere. Not there."|"It's thin tonight. It's been thin a while."|"Eat it while it's hot. It won't get any bigger."} #speaker:them
-> END

=== c4_folk_walkways ===
{"Hold the rope, not the post. Posts rot."|"Lovely day for it."|"You're the new one. Everyone's talking."} #speaker:them
-> END

=== c4_folk_winch ===
{"Heave. Heave. Rest."|"Out of the way, that one's heavy."|"Down it goes. Same as yesterday."} #speaker:them
-> END

=== c4_folk_homestead ===
{"Up there's no business of ours."|"What do you want? We've nothing to trade today."} #speaker:them
-> END

=== c4_ascended_workshop ===
{"Steady hands. That's all it ever was."|"We used to pray for these. Now we make them. Funny."} #speaker:them
-> END

=== c4_ascended_hall ===
{"I went up with my last bowl in my arms. I thought I'd never be cold again."|"Sit down, child. You look like I did."|"Don't ask me how long. I stopped counting."} #speaker:them
-> END
